---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | WCE CGPA to Percentage Calculator"
  description="Privacy policy and data handling principles for the WCE CGPA to Percentage Calculator."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-binance-card border border-binance-yellow/30 text-xs font-mono text-binance-yellow">
        <span>Privacy & Data Protection</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">
        Privacy <span class="text-binance-yellow">Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-binance-muted">Last Updated: Academic Year 2023-24</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-binance-card rounded-2xl border border-binance-border p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 text-xs font-mono text-binance-text leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-binance-yellow">1. Client-Side Execution Guarantee</h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted">
          All calculations, SGPA aggregation, and CGPA conversions are processed entirely inside your client browser via local JavaScript execution. No student scores, marks, names, or grade records are transmitted to, stored on, or processed by external web servers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-binance-yellow">2. Local Storage Usage</h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted">
          If you use the "Save Log" feature, the application uses your web browser's standard <code class="text-white bg-binance-canvas px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-binance-border">localStorage</code> API. This data remains on your physical device and can be erased anytime by clicking the "Clear All" button.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-binance-yellow">3. Analytics & Telemetry</h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted">
          We do not track personally identifiable information (PII). Anonymous aggregate traffic metrics may be collected solely to assess server availability and performance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-binance-yellow">4. External Links</h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted">
          Our website contains links to external institutional websites (e.g., Walchand College of Engineering's official portal at walchandsangli.ac.in). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external sites.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
